        {
          "text": "I hongo ma cwir, Kere Nebukadineza ooro t'ikelo go i Babilon paka jatwec, kanyacel g'atewe ma welo wok i Ot pa Rwoth; aka oketho Zedekia omin Yehoyakin paka kere ma Yuda gi Yerusalem.",
