          "text": "Zedekia ogwenyere kwoŋ Kere Nebukadineza, m'omiyo go kwoŋirok i nyingi Were nike lawinjo go. Go otimo wictek to tweyo cunye aka okwero gik bongi Rwoth Were pa Isiraili. ",
