        },
        {
          "text": "Medo kwoŋ meno, jotel ma Yuda, jocway ri Were i wi migam kodi ji je joluwo mienirok pa nonin m'oyido jothoko jo, aka jokoco Ot pa Rwoth m'oyido oloko maleŋ i Yerusalem. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rwoth, Were pa kwarere pajo oyido omedere dhiro jotuci wac Were piro jo, kwoŋbedo go oyido nitie gi wor ri ji pere kodi ot pere, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "to jomedo ŋalo jomikwenda pa Were, cayo wac pa Were, kodi nyero jotuci wac Were pere, tundo kama keme pa Rwoth olokere madwoŋ kwoŋ jo to m'ongoye both.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
